  "2026-08-07T16:44:25.127Z",codex-root,Exact all-status searches for trace/list trace/get and trace/contexts returned zero items; semantic searches found adjacent automation runtime and diagnostics lineage but no equivalent trace feature.
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-07T16:44:25.127Z",codex-root,Credentials endpoints entity IDs automation IDs run IDs context IDs and raw trace payloads remain outside Git and PM evidence; only redacted contract shapes counts and booleans may be recorded.
