body: "Research source: official Home Assistant Core 2026.8.0 trace WebSocket implementation plus the public WebSocket API protocol. Scope: typed trace list get and context discovery for automation and script domains; deterministic bounded output; explicit identifiers for exact trace retrieval; generic ws call remains the forward-compatible escape hatch. Safety: all commands are read-only and live evidence persists only redacted schemas counts and booleans. Breakpoint mutation and runtime debug controls are intentionally excluded pending a separate safety design."
